  <description
  >&lt;h2&gt;Choose an instant, then view it in New York&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Enter &lt;b&gt;01:30 on 25 October 2026&lt;/b&gt; in &lt;b&gt;Europe/London&lt;/b&gt;. The clocks go back that morning, so choose explicitly between the two occurrences.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;You can also change the timezone. Next runs the Chrono Convert action to show that exact instant in &lt;b&gt;America/New_York&lt;/b&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
  <formulas>
