    <fields>
      <name>Instructions</name>
      <fieldText
      >&lt;h2&gt;Choose an instant, then view it in New York&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Enter &lt;b&gt;01:30 on 25 October 2026&lt;/b&gt; in &lt;b&gt;Europe/London&lt;/b&gt;. The clocks go back that morning, so choose explicitly between the two occurrences.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;You can also change the timezone. Next runs the Chrono Convert action to show that exact instant in &lt;b&gt;America/New_York&lt;/b&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</fieldText>
      <fieldType>DisplayText</fieldType>
    </fields>
    <fields>
      <name>OverrideTip</name>
      <fieldText
      >&lt;p&gt;You can reopen the offset beside the time to change an occurrence. To try a customer override, enter 15 March 2026 at 10:00 in London and apply +01:00: the instant becomes 09:00 UTC, while the input stays 10:00 and is labelled Override. Return to automatic restores London's rules.&lt;/p&gt;</fieldText>
      <fieldType>DisplayText</fieldType>
    </fields>
